===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|Irish|slang}} A job or income which is taken in addition to one's normal employment, generally at evenings or weekends. Originally implied that payment was not declared for taxation, but now refers to any work that is not part of one's regular job.
* {{quote|en|author=Rayana Zapryanova|title=Doing nixers now a trend among young people as recession looms|date=2022-06-22|passage=Doing '''nixers''' no longer needs to be considered a ‘dirty secret’, says Robert Walters Ireland CEO Suzane Feeney, encouraging businesses to have an open mind about their employees' extra-curricular activities. “Don’t underestimate what value a side-hustle can bring to the day job,” she said.}}

